{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/0f4495fd669a347324f83277017b4b79.avif?t=1755197887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras_big/0f4495fd669a347324f83277017b4b79.avif?t=1755197887 width=1600 height=928 /></span><i> </i><br><i>Last Summer</i> is a 2D narrative adventure with retro aesthetics and metroidvania-inspired gameplay. You play as a kid with a big imagination, exploring a fragmented city where each district faces a different social or environmental issue. As you move through these areas, lifeless and grey spaces slowly turn into vibrant, colorful places full of life again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/edcec94b13a8003bafe12f269ab94ce5.poster.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1600 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/edcec94b13a8003bafe12f269ab94ce5.webm?t=1755197887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/edcec94b13a8003bafe12f269ab94ce5.mp4?t=1755197887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique 90s-inspired neighborhoods, unlock special abilities like jumping, running, grappling, and strength, and overcome symbolic enemies. Each district includes a dungeon with its own mechanic, a new skill to learn, a boss fight, and a magical reward to help you progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/fd89239aaa97ec1d3e8d1be0135015d5.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1252 height=326 /></span><br>The world is filled with secrets, side characters, and stories that reflect themes such as pollution, abandonment, social disconnection, and growing up. Your journey takes you across the city of Foultover\u2019s four districts, culminating in the mysterious Night District, where a powerful industry hides the truth behind it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Last Summer</i> is a single-player experience that blends exploration, storytelling, platforming, and emotional discovery with a nostalgic visual style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/b8fc75863192a5268b7f1a4f43ee1d38.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1252 height=206 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/337fdabe3c9cf94d28f3892605cd5ed5.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1252 height=208 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937880?t=1755197887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937880?t=1755197887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/0846c5696e5a925a65dda05ff667896469dcfada/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755197887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/0846c5696e5a925a65dda05ff667896469dcfada/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755197887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/0f4495fd669a347324f83277017b4b79.avif?t=1755197887\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras_big/0f4495fd669a347324f83277017b4b79.avif?t=1755197887 width=1600 height=928 /></span><i> </i><br><i>Last Summer</i> is a 2D narrative adventure with retro aesthetics and metroidvania-inspired gameplay. You play as a kid with a big imagination, exploring a fragmented city where each district faces a different social or environmental issue. As you move through these areas, lifeless and grey spaces slowly turn into vibrant, colorful places full of life again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/edcec94b13a8003bafe12f269ab94ce5.poster.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1600 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/edcec94b13a8003bafe12f269ab94ce5.webm?t=1755197887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/edcec94b13a8003bafe12f269ab94ce5.mp4?t=1755197887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique 90s-inspired neighborhoods, unlock special abilities like jumping, running, grappling, and strength, and overcome symbolic enemies. Each district includes a dungeon with its own mechanic, a new skill to learn, a boss fight, and a magical reward to help you progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/fd89239aaa97ec1d3e8d1be0135015d5.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1252 height=326 /></span><br>The world is filled with secrets, side characters, and stories that reflect themes such as pollution, abandonment, social disconnection, and growing up. Your journey takes you across the city of Foultover\u2019s four districts, culminating in the mysterious Night District, where a powerful industry hides the truth behind it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Last Summer</i> is a single-player experience that blends exploration, storytelling, platforming, and emotional discovery with a nostalgic visual style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/b8fc75863192a5268b7f1a4f43ee1d38.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1252 height=206 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/extras/337fdabe3c9cf94d28f3892605cd5ed5.avif?t=1755197887\" width=1252 height=208 /></span></p>","developers":["Cometa Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937880/a92a11583ccb0782068a9d8be70951fcdb8541e1/header.jpg?t=1755197887","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Last Summer","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Compatible con DirectX<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No compatible con VR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Optimizado para dispositivos de bajo rendimiento.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Cometa Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_g